high 2850 (bar 114).", "Bars 1-7 close 2006.31, 2006.06, 1859.02, 1813.04, 1731, 1581.32, 1568.55 (seven consecutive lower closes); bar 7 spans 1599.27-1368.42 and closes 1568.55, well above its low.", "Bars 8-44 stay inside 1512.91 (bar 27 low) and 1845.09 (bar 16 high); no close exceeds 1845.09, and lows after bar 27 rise (1551.6, 1560.05, 1597.72, 1694.74, 1751.07).", "Bars 45-58 print higher highs 1891.66, 1944.39, 1954.36, 1974.46 with pullbacks only to 1848.82/1850.53; bars 62-80 then hold a roughly 19-bar band above 1821.49 (bar 65 low).", "Bars 81-83 are three large bull trend bars closing 2252.16, 2326.32, 2515.3; bar 81 opens at the prior close 1916.51 and bar 83 reaches 2771.", "Bars 84-107 spend 24 bars inside 2357.18 (bar 95 low) and 2557.46 (bar 89 high); upside attempts fail to hold: bar 104 high 2680 closes 2514.72, bar 107 high 2609.02 closes 2514.07.", "Bar 108 prints 2358.62, slightly above the 2357.18 low (bar 95); bars 111-114 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, all above the 2557.46 range top.", "Bars 115-120 overlap between 2633.31 (bar 117 low) and 2786.81 (bar 116 high), closing 2752.43, 2684.16, 2686.59, 2690.56, 2694.96, 2685.9; no print above 2850 since bar 114.", "Last bar (120) 2694.96/2718.83/2668.55/2685.9 is a small-range, doji-like bar fully contained inside bar 116's 2752.43-2641.37 range."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: seven lower closes with the largest bear bar last (1599.27-1368.42, close 1568.55), leaving a long lower tail above the window low 1368.42 - a selling-climax shape at the bottom.", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780185600000, "upper_boundary": "2035.94"}, {"description": "Broad two-sided range after the low: about 37 overlapping bars capped by 1845.09 (bar 16) and floored by 1512.91 (bar 27); later bars inside it make successively higher lows.", "end_time_ms": 1783900800000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1845.09"}, {"description": "Rising leg from 1773.57 to 1974.46 (bar 58) with higher highs and only shallow pullbacks, then a flattening ~19-bar base that holds above 1821.49 before the spike.", "end_time_ms": 1787097600000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "1773.57", "start_time_ms": 1783987200000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike of three large trend bars (bars 81-83) closing 2252.16, 2326.32, 2515.3 and running 1905.63 to 2771.", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range of 24 bars between 2357.18 (bar 95) and 2557.46 (bar 89); two upside attempts (bar 104 high 2680, bar 107 high 2609.02) closed back inside.", "end_time_ms": 1789344000000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Bull breakout leg: bar 108 holds a higher low 2358.62, then bars 111-114 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, accepting above the 2557.46 range top and printing the window high 2850.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Six-bar tight pause just under the high: bars 115-120 overlap between 2633.31 and 2786.81 with flat closes near 2685-2752, holding above the old 2557.46 range top.", "end_time_ms": 1790467200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Two consecutive closes above 2786.81 (bar 116 high) would confirm the pause resolved upward and extend the bull leg beyond the 2850 high.", "A close back below 2557.46 (post-spike range top) would mark the breakout as failed and shift the read toward trading-range.", "A close below 2358.62 / 2357.18 (bars 108 / 95 lows) would break the higher-low sequence and weaken the bull-trend classification.", "Bars continuing to overlap between 2633.31 and 2786.81 with ranges near 50-100 points keep the phase a tight pause (range-like) rather than a spike.", "A decisive close below 2633.31 while holding under 2786.81 would make the six-bar pause the dominant structure and raise the case for transition-unclear."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "short", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790582399999, "directional_pressure": "bear", "evidence_against": ["The window's dominant stretch is still a bull sequence of higher highs and higher lows from 2358.62 (1789488000000) to 2850.00 (1789977600000), so a bull-trend descriptor for the full 120 bars remains arguable.", "Every post-climax low so far, including the newest low 2637.00 (1790568000000), is still above the 2633.31 range low, so the higher-low structure of the larger bull move is not broken yet.", "The coil's low volume could equally be read as a bull-flag pullback rather than a completed range, in which case the tape is pausing, not ranging.", "The last two bars are consecutive bear bars leaving a 12-bar coil, so if 2633.31 gives way with follow-through the better description becomes a bear leg or transition rather than a range."], "evidence_for": ["No new high for about 42 bars after 2850.00 (1789977600000) while swing highs step down 2804.59 to 2786.81 to 2718.83, the classic shape of a range after a climax.", "Both expansion bars were absorbed rather than continued: the 2457.12-to-2680.00 bar at 1789128000000 and the 2658.81-to-2850.00 bar at 1789977600000 were followed by pullbacks into prior price, so neither produced accepted trend continuation.", "The 2633-2648 zone (2633.31, 2643.44, 2648.49) has been tested repeatedly with recoveries, and the 2804.59-2718.83 zone has been sold repeatedly, i.e. two-sided trade with both boundaries respected.", "Bars 1790395200000-1790539200000 overlap heavily with several ranges under 20 points and per-bar volume near 1.9M-3.9M, which is quiet two-sided trade rather than a directional trend leg.", "The most recent leg is a five-bar decline from 2718.83 to 2637.00 with the last two bars closing near their lows, so within the range the momentary pressure leans down."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens at 2478.24 and the first ~40 bars are two-sided between roughly 2358.62 and 2544.63; the 1789128000000 bar is a wide bull trend bar (open 2457.12, high 2680.00, close 2555.52) that started the bull leg.", "Window low 2358.62 prints at 1789488000000; from there a run of higher lows and higher highs carries to the window high 2850.00 at 1789977600000, with one more push to 2804.59 at 1790020800000.", "Since 2850.00 there is no new high in ~42 bars and swing highs step down: 2804.59 (1790020800000) to 2786.81 (1790136000000) to 2718.83 (1790496000000).", "Post-climax lows cluster repeatedly: 2648.49 (1790164800000), 2633.31 (1790236800000), 2643.44 (1790553600000), 2637.00 (1790568000000); each earlier test was bought back.", "Bars 1790395200000 to 1790539200000 form a tight coil: heavily overlapping bodies, highs 2692.84-2718.83, lows 2665.14-2690.36, several bar ranges under 20 points and per-bar volume down to roughly 1.9M-3.9M.", "Last two bars are bear bars closing near their lows: 1790553600000 (open 2685.90, low 2643.44, close 2650.74) and 1790568000000 (open 2650.74, low 2637.00, close 2645.21); they exit the coil below 2665-2668 but the 2633.31 range low is still untested.", "Last close 2645.21 is about 7.2% under the 2850.00 high and sits in the lower part of the post-climax range; volume expanded on the last two down bars versus the quiet coil."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bull swing with higher lows and higher highs from the 2358.62 low to the 2850.00 climax high; the last bar of the leg (1789977600000, open 2658.81, high 2850.00, close 2723.15) is an expansion bar followed by one more bar to 2804.59 before the leg stalled.", "end_time_ms": 1789977600000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Post-climax trading range: after 2850.00 the market spent ~42 bars overlapping between the 2804.59 swing high and the 2633.31 low, with repeated failed pushes in both directions and no acceptance above 2850.00.", "end_time_ms": 1790568000000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790020800000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Tight coil inside the range: overlapping small-range bars between 2665.14 and 2718.83 with fading volume; the final two bars broke below this coil without yet reaching the 2633.31 range low, so the coil's exit has no acceptance or follow-through confirmation yet.", "end_time_ms": 1790553599999, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2665.14", "start_time_ms": 1790395200000, "upper_boundary": "2718.83"}, {"description": "Possible major-trend-reversal shape that is not confirmed: bull leg ended at 2850.00, price broke down to 2648.49, then rallied to a lower high 2718.83 versus 2804.59; confirmation would require losing 2633.31, which has not happened.", "end_time_ms": 1790568000000, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Two consecutive H4 closes below 2633.31 (1790236800000 low) with expanding range would shift the read from range toward bear-trend or transition-unclear.", "Acceptance back above 2718.83 with a strong bull close and follow-through would re-cast the coil as a bull-flag resolution and support a bull-trend read.", "Continued overlap between roughly 2648 and 2719 with 2633.31 intact would reinforce the trading-range read and keep always-in relevance low.", "A quick recovery of the coil break, for example a close back above 2668.55 (1790539200000 low) on a bull bar, would mark the downside exit as a failed break and return the read to two-sided range.", "New lower swing highs beneath 2718.83 accompanied by rising volume would indicate a developing bear channel inside the range rather than a neutral range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2719.63", "close_time_ms": 1790168399999, "high": "2727.77", "low": "2714.88", "open": "2726.71", "open_time_ms": 1790164800000, "volume": "1948014.057"}, {"close": "2714.8", "close_time_ms": 1790171999999, "high": "2722.14", "low": "2708.27", "open": "2719.63", "open_time_ms": 1790168400000, "volume": "2128922.964"}, {"close": "2676.14", "close_time_ms": 1790175599999, "high": "2722.14", "low": "2648.49", "open": "2714.8", "open_time_ms": 1790172000000, "volume": "2852582.234"}, {"close": "2659", "close_time_ms": 1790179199999, "high": "2681.07", "low": "2655.22", "open": "2675.6", "open_time_ms": 1790175600000, "volume": "2063501.661"}, {"close": "2659.73", "close_time_ms": 1790182799999, "high": "2666.01", "low": "2641.37", "open": "2658.15", "open_time_ms": 1790179200000, "volume": "2452881.85"}, {"close": "2665.44", "close_time_ms": 1790186399999, "high": "2668.02", "low": "2649.16", "open": "2659.73", "open_time_ms": 1790182800000, "volume": "1997918.483"}, {"close": "2668.2", "close_time_ms": 1790189999999, "high": "2672.55", "low": "2658.43", "open": "2666.02", "open_time_ms": 1790186400000, "volume": "1691460.012"}, {"close": "2676.47", "close_time_ms": 1790193599999, "high": "2681.21", "low": "2664.47", "open": "2668.2", "open_time_ms": 1790190000000, "volume": "1829822.575"}, {"close": "2669.46", "close_time_ms": 17901